  <meta name="description" content="Explore the historical and theological connection between Amen (Amun), Min and Amen–Min–Kamutef, with sources, illustrations, and SwamiG Institute's Khemetic contemplation.">
  <title>Amen &amp; Min | Hidden Power, Generative Life | SwamiG Institute</title>
  <style>
    :root{--ink:#090a13;--dusk:#121223;--panel:#191724;--panel2:#23202c;--paper:#f5e9d4;--muted:#c8b9a3;--gold:#e5c176;--gold2:#f4dfa4;--purple:#c28bdc;--green:#8fc2a6;--line:rgba(228,191,113,.28);--max:1160px}
    *,*:before,*:after{box-sizing:border-box}
